(7703034, 1264756, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great action of the powerful waves crashing up on and near the lighthouse. Love that this captures the faint sun rays to the left and the seagull in flight. Very well seen and captured!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great action of the powerful waves crashing up on and near the lighthouse. Love that this captures the faint sun rays to the left and the seagull in flight. Very well seen and captured!', '2021-10-09 21:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703035, 1264782, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Absolutely love the light illuminating those mountains in the background. Well framed with the motion of the waves washing on the sandy shore. It acts as a leading line from the right bottom of frame guiding our eye to explore this waterscape all the way to the mountains in the distance.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Absolutely love the light illuminating those mountains in the background. Well framed with the motion of the waves washing on the sandy shore. It acts as a leading line from the right bottom of frame guiding our eye to explore this waterscape all the way to the mountains in the distance.', '2021-10-09 21:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703036, 1264760, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The B&amp;W serves this scene very well - the photo projects a heavy and brooding mood. The day is grey and one can feel the rainstorms that are soon to come. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The B&W serves this scene very well - the photo projects a heavy and brooding mood. The day is grey and one can feel the rainstorms that are soon to come. Well done!', '2021-10-09 21:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703037, 1264587, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful and serene! Love how the sun is beginning to rise over the mountains and the first touches of light play on the rocky walls that line the river.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful and serene! Love how the sun is beginning to rise over the mountains and the first touches of light play on the rocky walls that line the river.', '2021-10-09 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703038, 1264746, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful minimal overhead scene of the ocean waves washing ashore! The flags and the single lone person walking the beach gives a sense of scale.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful minimal overhead scene of the ocean waves washing ashore! The flags and the single lone person walking the beach gives a sense of scale.', '2021-10-09 21:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703039, 1264755, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Gorgeous scene of the mountainous &amp; rocky landscape that contrasts and complements the silky, cascading waterfall into the river!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Gorgeous scene of the mountainous & rocky landscape that contrasts and complements the silky, cascading waterfall into the river!', '2021-10-09 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703040, 1264731, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The power and thunder of the falling water upon the stones is very palpable! Beautiful scene and capture but even better is the experience of being there to see, hear, and touch nature''s beauty and explore the surrounding area! Well seen and captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The power and thunder of the falling water upon the stones is very palpable! Beautiful scene and capture but even better is the experience of being there to see, hear, and touch nature''s beauty and explore the surrounding area! Well seen and captured.', '2021-10-09 21:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703041, 1264714, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a beautiful morning! The sounds of the waves washing ashore, the feel of the wet sand as one strolls the beach, the clean salt air and the early morning light. Very easy to place one''s self into the picture talking a calming stroll on this beach.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a beautiful morning! The sounds of the waves washing ashore, the feel of the wet sand as one strolls the beach, the clean salt air and the early morning light. Very easy to place one''s self into the picture talking a calming stroll on this beach.', '2021-10-09 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703042, 1264490, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very serene and minimal beauty to this waterscape. Love the golden color that illuminates the water and the bird flying just above the surface is a visual treat.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very serene and minimal beauty to this waterscape. Love the golden color that illuminates the water and the bird flying just above the surface is a visual treat.', '2021-10-09 21:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703043, 1264745, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the scene here! A clear and tranquil day with the water like glass. The six boats resting in the water are the visual treat in this minimalist capture. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the scene here! A clear and tranquil day with the water like glass. The six boats resting in the water are the visual treat in this minimalist capture. Well done!', '2021-10-09 21:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703044, 1264767, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the sense of movement and colors in this long exposure capture of a day at the seashore! Minimalist beauty captured within a frame made to invoke the idea of an old style photograph or of a Polaroid instant picture.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the sense of movement and colors in this long exposure capture of a day at the seashore! Minimalist beauty captured within a frame made to invoke the idea of an old style photograph or of a Polaroid instant picture.', '2021-10-09 22:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703045, 1264676, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Simple elegant and minimalist beauty in this B&amp;W capture! Long exposure makes the sea look like glass adding a feel of tranquility. The 4 wooden posts stand alone filling the left foreground. My eye then travels to what is in the distance with the crumbling Brighton Pier.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Simple elegant and minimalist beauty in this B&W capture! Long exposure makes the sea look like glass adding a feel of tranquility. The 4 wooden posts stand alone filling the left foreground. My eye then travels to what is in the distance with the crumbling Brighton Pier.', '2021-10-09 22:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703050, 1264764, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your photography really caught my eye. I like everything about it. The children''s delight provokes a smile on my face. My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Your photography really caught my eye. I like everything about it. The children''s delight provokes a smile on my face. My favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-10 08:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703069, 1264810, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Well seen! My eye constantly looks at this capture to figure out which is up and which is down. The line of trees lulls one into thinking that it is above ground but then on closer look the leaves in the water and shadow reflection of one tree in the water are above the trees. The ''sky'' and trees have changed places in this captivating photo. My only suggestion on how to possibly improve on the photo is to increase the contrast between light and shadows to make it visually pop a bit more.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Well seen! My eye constantly looks at this capture to figure out which is up and which is down. The line of trees lulls one into thinking that it is above ground but then on closer look the leaves in the water and shadow reflection of one tree in the water are above the trees. The ''sky'' and trees have changed places in this captivating photo. My only suggestion on how to possibly improve on the photo is to increase the contrast between light and shadows to make it visually pop a bit more.', '2021-10-10 12:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703070, 1264768, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A lovely and inviting picture of the seashore - the tranquility of the scene beacons the viewer to take off ones shoes and take a stroll on the wet sand.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A lovely and inviting picture of the seashore - the tranquility of the scene beacons the viewer to take off ones shoes and take a stroll on the wet sand.', '2021-10-10 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703071, 1264434, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Calm and tranquil scenery. This invites the viewer to take a seat on the bank of the river and just enjoy the quiet hush of the beauty before us. It is very easy to hear the gentle rippling of the water as it touches the shore and the air is crisp and cool.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Calm and tranquil scenery. This invites the viewer to take a seat on the bank of the river and just enjoy the quiet hush of the beauty before us. It is very easy to hear the gentle rippling of the water as it touches the shore and the air is crisp and cool.', '2021-10-10 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703072, 1264797, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow! That is a lot of seabirds/pelicans resting and flocking towards what looks to be from the shape two large boats sitting next to each other. The colors of the sunset dances upon the waves of the ocean. Very captivating and I imagine it was a fantastic sight to behold.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow! That is a lot of seabirds/pelicans resting and flocking towards what looks to be from the shape two large boats sitting next to each other. The colors of the sunset dances upon the waves of the ocean. Very captivating and I imagine it was a fantastic sight to behold.', '2021-10-10 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7703073, 1264804, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the colors and the beauty of this location! The details are wonderful from the strata on the rocks to the ripples of the waves and surface of the ocean. Beautiful!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the colors and the beauty of this location! The details are wonderful from the strata on the rocks to the ripples of the waves and surface of the ocean. Beautiful!', '2021-10-10 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
